## 2. Changes Summary

### Scope Fence Adherence
Only files within the designated scope fence were modified:
- [`libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py)
- [`libs/lang/src/lang/ast.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/ast.py)
- [`libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py)

### Fix 1 (`s4-sol-r2-hash-raw-store-span`): Scanner Hash-Raw String Recognition
- In [`libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py), added [`_scan_raw_string`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py#L974-L990) to parse arbitrary hash-count raw strings (`r"..."`, `r#"..."#`, `r##"..."##`, etc.) and return the index after closing delimiter (or `n` if unterminated).
- Updated [`_scan_kdl_node_end`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py#L993-L1075) to recognize raw strings both at token start and embedded inside bare tokens/properties (e.g. `backend=r#"fi" fake"#`).
- Updated [`effective_store_clause`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py#L1078-L1174) top-level state machine to atomically skip raw strings in `_CODE` state.

### Fix 2 (`s4-sol-r2-storeclausespan-doc-stale`): `StoreClauseSpan` Docstring Truth
- In [`libs/lang/src/lang/ast.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/ast.py#L698-L710), updated the docstring of [`StoreClauseSpan`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/src/lang/ast.py#L698-L710) to describe the true sub-line clause span behavior where trailing bytes (comments, terminators) are preserved on rewrite.

### Regression Tests Added
Added four tests to [`TestEffectiveStoreClause`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py#L3480-L3688) in [`libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py):
- `(a)` [`test_raw_string_property_with_trailing_comment_preserves_tail`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py#L3622-L3637): Span ends at `"#` and rewrite preserves trailing same-line comment `// KEEP OPERATOR " tail` byte-for-byte.
- `(b)` [`test_raw_string_property_no_old_property_leak_on_rewrite`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py#L3639-L3660): Span ends at `"#` and rewrite leaves no leaked old-property bytes (`fake"#`, etc.).
- `(c)` [`test_nested_hash_raw_string_property`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py#L3662-L3679): Nested hash form `r##"..."##` with embedded `"#` correctly scanned and preserved.
- `(d)` [`test_unterminated_raw_string_raises_parse_error`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-solfix2/libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py#L3681-L3688): Unterminated raw strings (`backend=r#"unterminated`, `store r#"unterminated`, `backend=r##"unterminated"#`) produce refuse-shaped `ParseError`.

