## 6. Honest Gaps & Observations

- **Scope discipline**: Zero files outside `libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py`, `libs/lang/src/lang/ast.py`, and `libs/lang/tests/test_loader.py` were modified.
- **Pre-existing lints**: Pre-existing line-length and import ordering notices exist elsewhere in `libs/lang/src/lang/loader.py` and `test_loader.py`; no new linter violations were introduced by our changes.
- **CKDL dependency**: `ckdl` correctly handles raw strings conforming to the KDL specification during the parse pass, and our hand-rolled scanner now mirrors this behavior accurately during the span-identification pass without consuming comments or subsequent nodes.
